# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Manuscript sources and the arXiv submission package.
# The paper is distributed through arXiv, not this repository. What the paper
# promises to release lives here and stays tracked: scripts/, the experiment
# ledger (paper/causal_detection_log.md) and the pre-registrations
# (paper/validation_protocol.md).
paper/*.tex
paper/*.pdf
paper/*.bib
paper/Makefile
paper/figs/
paper/arxiv/
paper/arxiv_submission.tar.gz

# Superseded drafts. These still assert claims the corrected manuscript
# withdraws (per-cell intervention resolution, the doubled CCM cost, the
# four-systems framing), so publishing them beside it would mislead.
paper/draft.md
paper/preprint_excess_detector.md
paper/preprint_mechanisms.md
paper/design_curve_discriminator.md
paper/proposal_depmap.md

# Manuscript-production tooling. These operate on the LaTeX, which is not
# distributed here; the analysis and verification scripts beside them are.
scripts/make_arxiv_package.py
scripts/render_float_pages.py
scripts/check_float_drift.py
scripts/check_float_refs.py
scripts/diagnose_render.py
scripts/check_citations.py

